{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"28"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/28/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Save Thy people and bless Thine inheritance, pasture them and bear them for ever. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/pesuqei_dezimrah/hoshiah_et_ammekha/psalms_33_20"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/20"}}
{"text":"Our soul waits for the Lord, He is our help and our shield."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/pesuqei_dezimrah/hoshiah_et_ammekha/psalms_33_21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/21"}}
{"text":"For in Him will our heart rejoice, for in His holy Name do we trust."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/pesuqei_dezimrah/hoshiah_et_ammekha/psalms_33_22"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/22"}}
{"text":"Let Thy grace, O Lord, be upon us just as we wait for Thee."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"85"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/85/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Show us, O Lord, Thy grace, and give us Thy salvation. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"44"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/44/27","n":"27"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Arise to be our help and redeem us for the sake of Thy grace. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"81"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/81/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"I am the Lord your God, who has brought you up from the land of Egypt, open your mouth wide and I will fill it. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"144"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/144/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Fortunate the people to "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:sic","attrs":{}}
{"text":"whem"}
{"end":"t:sic"}
{"start":"t:corr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"whom"}
{"end":"t:corr"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":" the like of this happens, fortunate the people whose God is the Lord. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/13/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And I trust in Thy grace, my heart revels in Thy salvation, I sing to the Lord for He has treated me well. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
